// C: 굵은 가로대와 떨어진 세 농기구 덩이, 최소 결과 보이는 윗면.
@size 32 16
@cell 16
@palette palette.pal
@mat a wood 3
@mat b wood 5
@mat c wood 6
@mat d wood 7
@mat e iron 1
@mat f iron 2
@mat g iron 3
@mat h iron 4
@mat i iron 5
@layer rack
@mblock 1 1
.cccccccccccccccccccccccccccc.
cdddddddccccccccdddddddccccccb
bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbba
aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
